{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『AKB48のオールナイトニッポン 乃木坂46スペシャル』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に出演させていただきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その前に\nSHOWROOMの方で\n超直前スペシャル\nということできいちゃんと30分間\n配信させていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/11/6349175/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2万人以上の方が\n観てくださってびっくり！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/11/6349175/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ANNの方はサンエトで出演させてもらったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校生のため出演できなかった\n蘭世もメールをくれました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニセ蘭世いっぱいいたけどもね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/11/6349175/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"貧乏メシ\nがテーマだったんですが\n参考になるものから ならないものまで！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/11/6349175/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも\nメール送ってくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/11/6349175/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後の\nまいちゅんのANN0の方にも\nちょっとお邪魔しちゃいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/11/6349175/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオ系女子だったり\nモーニングコールも2回出たり\nモーニングゼミナールにも出たり\nまあまあ出させていただいてますが\n今回も図々しく出ちゃったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんお疲れ様～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ANNに出演できるとか\nなんか有名人って感じがしますね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一つの名誉な感じしちゃってるもん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな夜中まで聴いてくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/11/6349175/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またサンエトで活動したいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/11/6349175/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ブランコ』MV撮影時の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は沈金だよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/11/6349175/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いから温かい格好できてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/11/6349175/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}